"D3\" x=\"143\" y=\"190\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"D4\" x=\"195\" y=\"190\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"D5\" x=\"247\" y=\"190\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#d94343\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"39\" y=\"261\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#22a05a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"273\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#111827\">Start</text><rect x=\"129\" y=\"261\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#d94343\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"273\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#111827\">Mål</text></svg></div><p>Labyrinten söks igenom med BFS (ordning ↑ → ↓ ←).</p>",
