    "t": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 253 236\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Labyrint med 3 rader (A–C) och 4 kolumner (1–4). Grön ruta är start, röd ruta är mål, mörka rutor är väggar.\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:253px;height:auto\"><title>Labyrint med 3 rader (A–C) och 4 kolumner (1–4). Grön ruta är start, röd ruta är mål, mörka rutor är väggar.</title><text x=\"65\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">1</text><text x=\"117\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">2</text><text x=\"169\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">3</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">4</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">A</text><rect data-cell=\"A1\" x=\"39\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"A2\" x=\"91\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#22a05a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"A3\" x=\"143\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"A4\" x=\"195\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">B</text><rect data-cell=\"B1\" x=\"39\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"B2\" x=\"91\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"B3\" x=\"143\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"B4\" x=\"195\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">C</text><rect data-cell=\"C1\" x=\"39\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"C2\" x=\"91\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"C3\" x=\"143\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"C4\" x=\"195\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#d94343\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"39\" y=\"209\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#22a05a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"221\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#111827\">Start</text><rect x=\"129\" y=\"209\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#d94343\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"221\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#111827\">Mål</text></svg></div><p>Labyrinten söks igenom med A* (h = Manhattanavstånd). Vid lika f väljs lägst h, och vid lika h den ruta som kommer först i bokstavsordning.</p><p>a) Fyll i tabellen med rutorna i den ordning de tas ut ur öppna listan.</p><table class=\"data\"><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align:left\">Tas ut</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">g</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">h</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">f</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">A2</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td><td style=\"text-align:left;min-width:7em;height:2.6em\"></td></tr></tbody></table><p>b) Vilken uttagen ruta ingår inte i vägen som A* returnerar?</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">A3 har lägre f än A1</p><p>A3: 1 + 3 = 4. A1: 1 + 5 = 6.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">A4 och B3 har samma f och h</p><p>Båda har f = 4 och h = 2. A4 kommer först i bokstavsordning, men är en återvändsgränd.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Sedan B3, C3 och målet</p><table class=\"data\"><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align:left\">Tas ut</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">g</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">h</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">f</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">A2</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">A3</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">3</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">A4</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">B3</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">C3</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">3</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">C4</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td></tr></tbody></table></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> A2, A3, A4, B3, C3, C4.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Vägen</p><p>A2 → A3 → B3 → C3 → C4.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">A4 leder inte vidare</p><p>Under A4 finns en vägg, så A4 har inga nya grannar.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> A4.</p></div></div></div></div>",
    "ledtrad": "<p>Alla rutor på en kortaste väg har samma f här. Då avgör h och sedan bokstavsordningen.</p>",
