    "t": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 490 321\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Graf med noderna S, A, B, C, D och M. Talet vid varje kant är kostnaden, och h står vid varje nod.\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:490px;height:auto\"><title>Graf med noderna S, A, B, C, D och M. Talet vid varje kant är kostnaden, och h står vid varje nod.</title><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"235\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"235\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"235\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"235\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"235\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect x=\"97\" y=\"94\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">2</text><rect x=\"97\" y=\"180\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">3</text><rect x=\"232\" y=\"52\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"245\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">3</text><rect x=\"232\" y=\"222\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"245\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">2</text><rect x=\"367\" y=\"94\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">2</text><rect x=\"367\" y=\"180\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">4</text><rect x=\"157\" y=\"137\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">1</text><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"150\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#22a05a\" stroke=\"#14532d\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">S</text><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"65\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">A</text><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"235\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">B</text><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"65\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">C</text><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"235\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">D</text><circle cx=\"440\" cy=\"150\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#d94343\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"440\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">M</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">h = 6</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">h = 4</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">h = 5</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">h = 2</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">h = 3</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">h = 0</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"295\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#22a05a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"41\" y=\"307\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#111827\">Start</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"295\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#d94343\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"131\" y=\"307\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#111827\">Mål</text></svg></div><p>Grafen söks igenom med A*. Talet vid varje kant är kostnaden att gå längs den, åt valfritt håll. Värdet h vid varje nod är en uppskattning av kostnaden kvar till målet M.</p><p>a) Vilken nod tar A* ut efter S? Välj ett alternativ.</p><p class=\"ul-alt\"><strong>A.</strong> Noden A</p><p class=\"ul-alt\"><strong>B.</strong> Noden B</p><p class=\"ul-alt\"><strong>C.</strong> Noden C</p><p class=\"ul-alt\"><strong>D.</strong> Noden M</p><p>b) Hur många noder tar A* ut, inklusive start och mål?</p><p>c) Vad kostar vägen som A* returnerar?</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Grannarna till S</p><p>A: f = 2 + 4 = 6. B: f = 3 + 5 = 8.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Noden A.</p><ul><li><strong>A:</strong> A har lägst f = 6.</li><li><strong>B:</strong> B har f = 3 + 5 = 8.</li><li><strong>C:</strong> C har inte lagts in i kön ännu.</li><li><strong>D:</strong> Målet har inte lagts in i kön ännu.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Uttag med g, h och f</p><table class=\"data\"><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align:left\">Tas ut</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">g</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">h</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">f</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">S</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">6</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">6</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">A</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">6</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">C</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">7</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">M</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">7</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">7</td></tr></tbody></table></li><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">B och D tas aldrig ut</p><p>Deras f-värden är högre än målets 7.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 4.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Vägen</p><p>S → A → C → M: 2 + 3 + 2 = 7.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 7.</p></div></div></div></div>",
    "ledtrad": "<p>Ta alltid ut noden med lägst f = g + h.</p>",
