    "t": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 357 288\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Labyrint med 4 rader (A–D) och 6 kolumner (1–6). Grön ruta är start, röd ruta är mål, mörka rutor är väggar.\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:357px;height:auto\"><title>Labyrint med 4 rader (A–D) och 6 kolumner (1–6). Grön ruta är start, röd ruta är mål, mörka rutor är väggar.</title><text x=\"65\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">1</text><text x=\"117\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">2</text><text x=\"169\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">3</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">4</text><text x=\"273\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">5</text><text x=\"325\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">6</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">A</text><rect data-cell=\"A1\" x=\"39\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"A2\" x=\"91\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"A3\" x=\"143\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"A4\" x=\"195\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"A5\" x=\"247\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"A6\" x=\"299\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">B</text><rect data-cell=\"B1\" x=\"39\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"B2\" x=\"91\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"B3\" x=\"143\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"B4\" x=\"195\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"B5\" x=\"247\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"B6\" x=\"299\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#d94343\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">C</text><rect data-cell=\"C1\" x=\"39\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#22a05a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"C2\" x=\"91\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"C3\" x=\"143\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"C4\" x=\"195\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"C5\" x=\"247\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"C6\" x=\"299\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">D</text><rect data-cell=\"D1\" x=\"39\" y=\"190\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"D2\" x=\"91\" y=\"190\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"D3\" x=\"143\" y=\"190\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"D4\" x=\"195\" y=\"190\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"D5\" x=\"247\" y=\"190\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect data-cell=\"D6\" x=\"299\" y=\"190\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"39\" y=\"261\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#22a05a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"273\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#111827\">Start</text><rect x=\"129\" y=\"261\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#d94343\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"273\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#111827\">Mål</text></svg></div><p>En gräsklipparrobot ska tillbaka till sin station.</p><p>Labyrinten söks igenom med A* (h = Manhattanavstånd). Vid lika f väljs lägst h, och vid lika h den ruta som kommer först i bokstavsordning.</p><p>a) Bestäm h för startrutan C1.</p><p>b) Bestäm f för rutan B1, som ligger bredvid start.</p><p>c) Vilken av grannarna till start har lägst f? Välj ett alternativ.</p><p class=\"ul-alt\"><strong>A.</strong> Rutan B1</p><p class=\"ul-alt\"><strong>B.</strong> Rutan D1</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Rader och kolumner från C1 till målet B6</p><p>1 + 5 = 6.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 6.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">g = 1</p><p>B1 ligger ett steg från start.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">f = g + h = 1 + 5</p><p>h = 0 + 5 = 5, så f = 6.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 6.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">f för grannarna</p><p>B1: 6, D1: 8. Lägst har B1.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Rutan B1.</p><ul><li><strong>A:</strong> B1 har f = 6, det lägsta.</li><li><strong>B:</strong> D1 har f = 8, mer än B1:s 6.</li></ul></div></div></div></div>",
    "ledtrad": "<p>f = g + h, och A* väljer lägst f.</p>",
