    "t": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 340\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Minimaxträd. Uppåtriktad triangel är MAX, nedåtriktad är MIN.\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;min-width:420px;height:auto\"><title>Minimaxträd med nyttovärden i löven</title><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"44\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"356\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"444\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"556\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"300,44 325,84 275,84\" fill=\"#dbf5f1\" stroke=\"#14857f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"333\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#334155\">R</text><polygon points=\"75,142 125,142 100,182\" fill=\"#fff0d9\" stroke=\"#b86b16\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"133\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#334155\">A</text><polygon points=\"275,142 325,142 300,182\" fill=\"#fff0d9\" stroke=\"#b86b16\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"333\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#334155\">B</text><polygon points=\"475,142 525,142 500,182\" fill=\"#fff0d9\" stroke=\"#b86b16\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"533\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#334155\">C</text><circle cx=\"44\" cy=\"260\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111827\">3</text><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"260\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111827\">5</text><circle cx=\"156\" cy=\"260\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111827\">2</text><circle cx=\"244\" cy=\"260\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"244\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111827\">6</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"260\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111827\">4</text><circle cx=\"356\" cy=\"260\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"356\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111827\">7</text><circle cx=\"444\" cy=\"260\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"444\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111827\">1</text><circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"260\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111827\">8</text><circle cx=\"556\" cy=\"260\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"556\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111827\">9</text><polygon points=\"20,7 29,23 11,23\" fill=\"#dbf5f1\" stroke=\"#14857f\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#334155\">MAX</text><polygon points=\"110,7 128,7 119,23\" fill=\"#fff0d9\" stroke=\"#b86b16\"/><text x=\"137\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#334155\">MIN</text></svg></div><p>Spelträdet söks igenom med minimax.</p><p>a) Bestäm värdena i A, B och C.</p><p>b) Vilket värde får roten?</p><p>c) Vilket barn ska roten välja?</p>",
