    "t": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 264\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Spelträd. Uppåtriktad triangel är MAX, nedåtriktad är MIN.\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px;min-width:420px;height:auto\"><title>Spelträd med MIN i roten R och 6 löv.</title><line x1=\"90.0\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"60.0\" y2=\"236\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"90.0\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"120.0\" y2=\"236\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"180.0\" y2=\"236\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"240.0\" y2=\"236\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"330.0\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"300.0\" y2=\"236\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"330.0\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"236\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"90.0\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"210.0\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"330.0\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"90.0,129 112.0,164 68.0,164\" fill=\"#dbf5f1\" stroke=\"#14857f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"117.0\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#334155\">A</text><polygon points=\"210.0,129 232.0,164 188.0,164\" fill=\"#dbf5f1\" stroke=\"#14857f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"237.0\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#334155\">B</text><polygon points=\"330.0,129 352.0,164 308.0,164\" fill=\"#dbf5f1\" stroke=\"#14857f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"357.0\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#334155\">C</text><polygon points=\"188.0,44 232.0,44 210.0,79\" fill=\"#fff0d9\" stroke=\"#b86b16\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"237.0\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#334155\">R</text><rect x=\"42.0\" y=\"220\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#64748b\"/><text x=\"60.0\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111827\">4</text><rect x=\"102.0\" y=\"220\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#64748b\"/><text x=\"120.0\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111827\">9</text><rect x=\"162.0\" y=\"220\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#64748b\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111827\">6</text><rect x=\"222.0\" y=\"220\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#64748b\"/><text x=\"240.0\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111827\">3</text><rect x=\"282.0\" y=\"220\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#64748b\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111827\">8</text><rect x=\"342.0\" y=\"220\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#64748b\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111827\">7</text><polygon points=\"20,7 29,23 11,23\" fill=\"#dbf5f1\" stroke=\"#14857f\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#334155\">MAX</text><polygon points=\"110,7 128,7 119,23\" fill=\"#fff0d9\" stroke=\"#b86b16\"/><text x=\"137\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#334155\">MIN</text></svg></div><p>Spelträdet söks igenom med minimax.</p><p>a) Vilka värden får MAX-noderna A, B och C?</p><p>b) Vilket värde får roten, och vilket drag väljer den?</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">A, B och C är MAX-noder</p><p>A = max(4, 9) = 9.</p><p>B = max(6, 3) = 6.</p><p>C = max(8, 7) = 8.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> A = 9, B = 6, C = 8.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Roten väljer det minsta värdet</p><p>R = min(9, 6, 8) = 6.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Värdet 6, draget till B.</p></div></div></div></div>",
    "ledtrad": "<p>Arbeta från löven och uppåt. Triangeln visar om noden väljer största eller minsta värdet.</p>",
